    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίστ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assurance, warrant, pledge</i>, mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				5.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				977
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				214
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1376a17
				</span></i>
			 : in sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλίας π. συγγενέσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.Com.
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ βεβαιότατον π. ἔχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>confirmation</i> of an argument, in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.285
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">S.,
				<u>Sign.</u>19</span></i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γηραλέα πιστώματα,῀πιστοὶ γέροντες</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				171
			</span></i> (troch.).</div>
